Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### 7.2 Create complaint against patient — 🔒 doctor — POST /api/doctors/complaints
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/complaints
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "against_type": "patient",
  "against_id": 1,
  "appointment_id": 1,
  "complaint_type": "Misbehavior",
  "description": "Patient repeatedly missed follow-up without notice."
}

