  "against_type": "staff",
  "against_id": 1,
  "complaint_type": "Unprofessional conduct",
  "description": "Staff unavailable during assigned duty hours."
}

### 7.4 My complaint history — 🔒 doctor — GET /api/doctors/complaints
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/complaints
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. Doctor — Schedule Management — 🔒 doctor — window 20:00-24:00 (8:00 PM–12:00 AM) today→Dec31
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 8.1 Window info — 🔒 doctor — GET /api/doctors/schedules/window — {currentDate, targetDate, isOpen, window:"20:00-24:00"} — 8:00 PM–12:00 AM, 12:00 AM is end-of-day (24:00), 00:00 next day is closed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/schedules/window
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### 8.2 List my schedules — 🔒 doctor — GET /api/doctors/schedules — today→Dec31
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### 8.3 Create schedule — 🔒 doctor — POST /api/doctors/schedules — ONLY when window 20:00-24:00 open else 403 WINDOW_CLOSED (test 19:59 closed, 20:00 open, 23:59 open, 00:00 closed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "available_date": "2026-09-24",
  "start_time": "10:00",
  "end_time": "11:00",
  "hospital_id": 1,
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### 8.4 Create minimal (defaults to today) — 🔒 doctor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "start_time": "14:00",
  "end_time": "15:00",
  "hospital_id": 1
}

### 8.5 Update own schedule — 🔒 doctor — PUT /api/doctors/schedules/:id — window 20:00-24:00 + today→Dec31 + not expired/WORKING
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/schedules/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "available_date": "2026-09-24",
  "start_time": "09:00",
  "end_time": "10:00",
  "hospital_id": 1,
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### 8.6 Toggle availability — 🔒 doctor — PATCH /api/doctors/schedules/:id/availability
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/schedules/1/availability
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "status": "UNAVAILABLE"
}

### 8.7 Toggle back — 🔒 doctor
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/schedules/1/availability
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "slot_status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### 8.8 Delete own slot — 🔒 doctor — DELETE /api/doctors/schedules/:id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/schedules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

