# =============================================================================
# 11. Frontend Auth (no API � JWT reuse) � manual verify
# =============================================================================
# Auto logout 5m: client/src/hooks/useInactivityLogout.js in DoctorDashboard.jsx:452.
#  Manual: login ? /doctor-dashboard ? idle 5m ? cleared + redirect to /doctor-login ? banner "You have been logged out due to inactivity." (DoctorLogin.jsx:15).
# Already logged in: visit /doctor-login while any token present ? block + Logout.
# Protected: /doctor-dashboard without token ? redirect to /doctor-login; admin token ? redirect to /login.

### 11.1 Smoke 401 without token � GET /api/doctors/profile without Authorization ? 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/profile
# No Authorization � expect 401

### 11.2 Smoke bad token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/profile
Authorization: Bearer bad.token.here

